    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +3 and ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate & chance of evading enemy's attack 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack\n*When another 2 or more \"Androids/Cell Saga\" Category allies are\non the team*\n- ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Guards all attacks\n*When 6 or more Super Class allies are on the team*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 60%{passiveImg:up_g} and launches\n3 additional attacks, each of which has a medium chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack, as the 1st attacker in a turn\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- \"Androids/Cell Saga\" Category Super Class allies' ATK & DEF 60%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK 200%{passiveImg:up_g} and DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When there is an enemy whose name includes \"Cell\"\n(characters such as Cell Jr. excluded)*\n- Performs a critical hit\n*At the start of the character's next attacking turn after the\ncharacter performs 5 or more attacks in battle, or when there is\nan enemy whose name includes \"Cell\" (characters such as Cell Jr.\nexcluded) starting from the 5th turn from the start of battle*\n- Transforms",
